From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Debayan Kar <kardebayan3@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:03:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] Add MIUI SDK compatibility classes

The R era MiuiCamera is built against the MIUI SDK (miui.apk and
miuisystem.apk) and the MIUI framework, which AOSP does not ship.
Add the classes it uses, generated from vendor/miuicamera-davinci/
miui-compat with generate-smali.sh, so that its activities, dialogs,
interpolators and reflection helpers link on AOSP.
